## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `main.ts` | Entry point; `run()` holds the command-line logic so it can be tested |
| `src/` | Library code, with `*_test.ts` tests beside each file |
| `deno.json` | Tasks, imports (JSR) and formatter settings |
| `docs/` | Documentation and ADRs |

Deno includes the formatter, linter, type checker and test runner, so there is no separate tool config.

## Decisions

Record significant decisions as short ADRs in `docs/adr/` (one file per decision).
